-- The first "What's New" announcement (2026-10-28): Handwritten Worked Solutions.
-- Run AFTER 2026-10-28-site-updates.sql. Idempotent (upsert by slug).
--
-- Generated by `npm run publish -- --update=handwritten-worked-solutions --target=static --sql`
-- (video/scripts/publish.mjs). The files are served from the site itself
-- (public/video/updates/handwritten-worked-solutions/) because the session that
